    coreEn: '==Hybrid Search== runs ==BM25 keyword search AND dense vector search in parallel==, then merges their ranked lists using ==Reciprocal Rank Fusion (RRF: `sum(1 / (k + rank))`)==—consistently beating either method alone by 10–25%!',
    coreHi: '==Hybrid Search== ==BM25 aur Vector Search dono ko parallel chalakar== unke results ko ==RRF (`1 / (60 + rank)`)== se combine karti hai—yeh akele vector search se 10–25% zyada accurate hoti hai!',
