    analogyEn: 'A document ranked high by BOTH keyword search and semantic search rockets to `#1` via RRF—without needing to normalize incompatible raw scores!',
    analogyHi: 'Jo document BM25 aur Vector dono mein upar aata hai, RRF use seedha `#1` par le aata hai—bina score scaling ke jhanjhat ke!',
    steps: [['Run BM25 Top-25', 'Catch exact codes, terms & names'], ['Run Vector Top-25', 'Catch synonyms & conceptual matches'], ['Fuse With RRF', '`score = 1/(60+r_bm25) + 1/(60+r_vec)`'], ['Pass to Reranker', 'Send merged top-20 to Cross-Encoder']],
